{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39714","headline":"喜陈先辈及第 · 黄滔","name":"喜陈先辈及第","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今年春已到京华，天与吾曹雪怨嗟。\n甲乙中时公道复，朝廷看处主司夸。\n飞离海浪从烧尾，咽却金丹定易牙。\n不是驾前偏落羽，锦城争得杏园花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39714.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39714","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}